invariant operation requestContextMiddleware "The current native API can read X-Request-Id but cannot allocate a new id in middleware without a crypto/random helper and string builder; handlers use a stable fallback id in static envelopes."
label startRequestContextMiddleware
storage local immutable requestIdHeaderName CNullTerminatedByteString "X-Request-Id"
call requestIdReadCall http.requestHeader
argument requestIdReadCall request HttpRequest request
argument requestIdReadCall name CNullTerminatedByteString requestIdHeaderName
run requestIdReadCall
bind value requestIdValue CNullTerminatedByteString requestIdReadCall
call requestIdNullCall pointer.isNull
argument requestIdNullCall ptr COpaqueMemoryAddress requestIdValue
run requestIdNullCall
bind value requestIdMissing Bool requestIdNullCall
branch if condition requestIdMissing target useFallbackRequestId
call requestIdHeaderCall http.responseHeader
argument requestIdHeaderCall response HttpResponse response
argument requestIdHeaderCall name CNullTerminatedByteString requestIdHeaderName
argument requestIdHeaderCall value CNullTerminatedByteString requestIdValue
run requestIdHeaderCall
ignore value source requestIdHeaderCall type CSignedInt32
jump target writePathHeader
label useFallbackRequestId
call fallbackRequestIdHeaderCall http.responseHeader
argument fallbackRequestIdHeaderCall response HttpResponse response
argument fallbackRequestIdHeaderCall name CNullTerminatedByteString requestIdHeaderName
argument fallbackRequestIdHeaderCall value CNullTerminatedByteString runtime.fallbackRequestId
run fallbackRequestIdHeaderCall
ignore value source fallbackRequestIdHeaderCall type CSignedInt32
label writePathHeader
call pathReadCall http.requestPath
argument pathReadCall request HttpRequest request
run pathReadCall
bind value requestPath CNullTerminatedByteString pathReadCall
storage local immutable pathHeaderName CNullTerminatedByteString "X-Route-Path"
call pathHeaderCall http.responseHeader
argument pathHeaderCall response HttpResponse response
argument pathHeaderCall name CNullTerminatedByteString pathHeaderName
argument pathHeaderCall value CNullTerminatedByteString requestPath
run pathHeaderCall
ignore value source pathHeaderCall type CSignedInt32
return value continueMiddlewareControl
